    1. priority_order
       Q: The priority list contains 'Throughput' three times instead of the actual KPIs (resource_efficiency, operator_fatigue, ambient_noise_level) — when resource_efficiency conflicts with the fatigue or noise constraint approaching its limit, which KPI should yield: should the optimiser protect the constraint and accept a lower efficiency score, or push efficiency until the hard constraint boundary is reached?
