    2. resource_efficiency.threshold
       Q: Resource efficiency is set to maximise with no upper bound — to prevent runaway resource consumption in pursuit of a better ratio, should we cap total resource use at some percentage above today's baseline (e.g., no single resource type may increase more than 20% above its current-shift baseline)?
