    3. context.resource_types (aggregation weights in efficiency denominator)
       Q: The efficiency formula divides delivered value by 'total_resource_consumed', which must combine energy (kWh), raw materials (kg or monetary), labour-hours, and machine-time into one number — what common unit or weighting scheme should be used (e.g., site monetary cost rates, CO₂-equivalent, or equal normalised shares of each resource's shift budget)?
